WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Three labeled TPMS pairs begin at the same center height: Diamond, Gyroid, and Primitive. Each has a slot and a tenon. Cast shadows are disabled.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The tenons begin lifting vertically in a staggered sequence: Diamond, Gyroid, then Primitive.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Diamond begins its elevated transfer; Gyroid and Primitive follow after finishing their lifts.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Diamond pauses over its aligned groove while the other tenons finish transferring.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.600
Each tenon pauses over its aligned groove, then lowers straight down. Diamond starts, followed by Gyroid and Primitive. Horizontal position stays fixed during insertion.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.000
Three seated pairs remain in view. The original porous geometries differ; each follows the vertical groove direction. This animation does not validate contact, clearance, or strength.
